\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwoNameSequence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TwoNameSequence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11ForcingRelationAtomicEquality}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11ForcingRelationAtomicEquality}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}two\\text{-}name\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{TwoNameSequence}_S(a,\\sigma,\\tau,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(a,2,M)\\land a(0)=\\sigma\\land a(1)=\\tau\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}two\\text{-}name\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{TwoNameSequence}_S(a,\\sigma,\\tau,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(a,2,M)\\land a(0)=\\sigma\\land a(1)=\\tau\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}relation\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}equality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11ForcingRelationAtomicEquality}_S(R,M,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow R=\\Bigl\\{\\langle p,\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle:p\\in P\\land\\sigma\\in M\\land\\tau\\in M\\land\\exists a\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TwoNameSequence}_S(a,\\sigma,\\tau,M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\ulcorner v_0\\doteq v_1\\urcorner,a,P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}relation\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}equality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11ForcingRelationAtomicEquality}_S(R,M,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow R=\\Bigl\\{\\langle p,\\sigma,\\tau\\rangle:p\\in P\\land\\sigma\\in M\\land\\tau\\in M\\land\\exists a\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TwoNameSequence}_S(a,\\sigma,\\tau,M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S(M,p,\\ulcorner v_0\\doteq v_1\\urcorner,a,P,\\leq_P)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ground model and forcing order are indispensable parameters of the upstream six-place forcing relation.</li>\n<li>参数元组现由定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> 的集合函数见证；Kuratowski 有序对不再被误传给要求序列编码的上游谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","l